            "text": "This classifier is intentionally evidence-only: it requires exact pre-raster identity before reporting a bounded CoreText residual, and it never feeds visual pass/fail. DM-2432/DM-2440 proved the first observable divergence at CTFontDrawGlyphs and separated the SF CFF2/provenance factors; the adjacent controls prevent broad face- or script-level classification.",
            "markdown": "This classifier is intentionally evidence-only: it requires exact pre-raster identity before reporting a bounded CoreText residual, and it never feeds visual pass/fail. DM-2432/DM-2440 proved the first observable divergence at CTFontDrawGlyphs and separated the SF CFF2/provenance factors; the adjacent controls prevent broad face- or script-level classification."
